                    Thomas J. Cory, USUN.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d595-f3" n="3" xml:id="d595-f3-content">
                <p>For further information on Gross’
                    remarks at this meeting, see Young’s
                    memorandum of conversation, Dec. 5, 1952, <ref target="#pg882">p. 882</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
